{
  "_doc": "P0 golden cases (WP-26). `cargo xtask pch-goldens p0` runs every case under the pinned pre-commit-hooks venvs of each golden tag and writes goldens/<tag>.json; tests/p0 replays them natively. Byte strings are latin-1 JSON strings (one char per byte). Steps: [w, path, bytes] write; [x, path] chmod 755; [ro, path] chmod 444; [mkdir, path]; [git, args...]; [gitfile, name, bytes] write under .git; [ln, target, path] symlink. A `partition` runs pre-commit's shuffle + xargs.partition (jobs, max length 131072) over its files, appending each partition to argv.",
